The handle is lowercase everywhere
=================================

volkdude85, not VolkDude85. In the window title, in the brand line, in the About panel, in the welcome
sentence, in the persona's own text, and in the edition label the package ships.

One convention rather than six, because a handle that changes case between the title bar and the
sidebar reads as two different names.

